   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PMU-BiH 99</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An Integrated Area Project for the Central Bosnia. The objective is torehabilitate villages and communities, targeting minority return. 180 families are expected to benefit from the project. The format used is help to self-help, but limited contracted work will also take place. The project will take 15 months to complete.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Integrerat omr&#xe5;desprogram f&#xf6;r centrala bosnien. M&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttningen &#xe4;r att &#xe5;teruppr&#xe4;tta byar och samh&#xe4;llen, s&#xe4;rskilt f&#xf6;r &#xe5;tervandrande  minoriteter. Projektet ber&#xe4;knas n&#xe5; c:a 180 familjer. Formen &#xe4;r framf&#xf6;r allt sj&#xe4;lvhj&#xe4;lp men &#xe4;ven visst kontrakterat arbete f&#xf6;rekommer.Projektet ber&#xe4;knas ta 15 m&#xe5;nader att slutf&#xf6;ra.</narrative>
  </description>
